Subject: [PATCH 167/168] XD Netplay: saved teams in the Submit Team sheets

Teams are kept as Showdown text files in <User>/XDNetplay/Teams/ (TeamInjector: ListSavedTeams,
LoadSavedTeam, SaveTeamText, DeleteSavedTeam). Both desktop sheets and the Android sheet get a
Saved teams picker that fills the team box, plus Save Team As... and Delete. Local only: no
netplay or save-file change.
